    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, thank you for calling VeloFit. My name is Isaac. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896513533333
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 43847,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896519133333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. To pull up your account, could I please get your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896521133333
    },
    {
      "text": "It's V-F-7-8-9-0-1-2.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 43847,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896527599999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. One moment... Okay, I see the order for the Pro-Level cycling shoes. Is that what you're calling about?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896529199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Obviously.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 43847,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896536999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright. And what specifically is the issue with the shoes? Is it a technical fault with them or more of a preference or fit issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896537866665
    },
    {
      "text": "They gave me blisters. Right on my heel. I can't even wear them.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 43847,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896546799998
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear that. I know how painful blisters can be, especially on a long ride. Does the fit feel off in other places, for example, around where the cleats are mounted?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896551266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, they just don't work for my feet. I want to send them back and get a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 43847,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896563466664
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. Let me just confirm the return eligibility for you. I see they were delivered 28 days ago. Let's see... yes, that's no problem at all. Our standard policy allows for returns within 90 days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896569133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So you'll do it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 43847,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896582666663
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolutely. I've just initiated the return in our system. I'm sending a pre-paid shipping label to the email we have on file. Just box up the cycling shoes, attach the label, and drop them off. Once we receive them at our warehouse, your refund will be processed.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896584333329
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I'll get the email.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 43847,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1765896602066662
    },
